    "commit": {
      "message": "Seal XDM Android Debug Workbench D7"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D7 is a final seal only; it does not add a new runtime debugger panel, top-level route, Room migration, automatic upload, transfer control, foreground service, viewer launch, browser-scheme launch, or probe.",
      "Debug Workbench shell UI and copy reports now use human support labels instead of raw enum names for check states and debug areas.",
      "The Phase 48 release-gate script now runs the D7 final-seal validator instead of the stale D1-only validator.",
      "D7 records the D6 green baseline: 414 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped; diagnostics 0 warnings, 0 errors.",
      "Artifact validation works from Devtool temp-root layout and from the Android root."
    ]
